 "description": "💫Dear dancers\nWe are thrilled to announce the 4th edition of Dance Affinity Festival!\n📍30.10 – 02.11 2026\n📍M.A.K Studios, Freiburg im Breisgau, Germany\n💚💜OUR UNIQUE CONCEPT💜💚\nAt Dance Affinity bootcamps are not an add‑on, they are the heart of the festival!\nEach bootcamp is led by 6 international teachers working 3 hrs together to bring you the highest quality of teaching with strong focus on:\n– technique\n– musicality\n– connection\n– experimentation\n– feedback & exercise\nLimited places, personalised guidance, and a real progression you feel throughout the weekend — this is what makes Dance Affinity unique.\n🔜 Stay tuned to not miss our special bootcamps!\n💫 WHAT TO EXPECT THIS YEAR\n– Workshops & Immersive bootcamps with international teachers\n– 2 dance floors – kizomba & bachata\n– 3 days of Day Socials & Night Parties with international DJs\n– A warm, intimate and community‑focused atmosphere\n– A festival created by dancers, for dancers\n🔽🔽🔽ARTIST LINEUP🔽🔽🔽\n💚Kizomba Artists💚\nLedoux Kingsman\nSelim & Anastasia\nLoyal\nEVOKEEZ Team Paris\nDaniel & Elina\n🤩More coming very soon…\n💚Kizomba Djs💚\nDj Le Grand Tiwosh\nDj Timeline\nDj Galaxy\n🤩More coming very soon…\n💜Bachata Artists💜\n🤩Coming very soon…\nBOOK YOUR PASS!\nhttps://my.weezevent.com/dance-affinity-2026\n💫Be Part of the Affinity!💫",
